# A random tiny Qwen3: this demonstrates debugger mechanics, not learned behavior.
checkpoint origin
step 2
checkpoint before-edit
inspect hidden
project analyze
project list --query decoder_layer
project callers port:hidden
project trace port:hidden --depth 2
project backtrace hidden
fork zero-carrier
set hidden 0
commit
inspect hidden
project finding port:hidden --title "Zeroed carrier on private fork" --kind observation --note "Explicit zero write at a retained layer boundary; no downstream capability claim."
project findings
restore before-edit
inspect hidden
project analyze
project analyses
